PTX MP2+mbarrier-rel-acq.cta
"Two producers, an arrival count of 2: the waiter whose test_wait returns True sees both producers' writes (all arrivals of the completed phase, 9.7.13.15.16). Expected: forbidden."
{
b=mbarrier(2) @cta 0;
x=0;
y=0;
P2:r0=0;
P2:r1=0;
P2:r2=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0      | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0      | P2@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 st.weak x, 1                  | st.weak y, 1                  | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0 ;
 mbarrier.arrive.release.cta b | mbarrier.arrive.release.cta b | ld.weak r1, x                                  ;
                               |                               | ld.weak r2, y                                  ;
exists
(P2:r0 == 1 /\ (P2:r1 == 0 \/ P2:r2 == 0))
